  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;color:#e67e22\">🤑奔跑骷髏跳嚇🤑</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:16px\">你在遊戲中每度過一秒，就有<strong>五千分之一（1/5000）的機率</strong>看到奔跑骷髏直接跑過你的遊戲畫面。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#c0392b\">🤡用指令惡搞你的朋友</h2>\n<p>如果你不想等待隨機觸發，或者你只是<strong>特別想</strong>嚇唬某人，請使用以下指令：</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f1f1f1;border:1px solid #ccc;font-family:monospace\">/playjumpscare_running_skeleton play_running_skeleton_jumpscare {player}</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚙️設定</h2>\n<p>你可以在設定檔中調整觸發機率。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">看看我的其他跳嚇模組<br></span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-freddy-jumpscare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">黃金佛雷迪跳嚇 [恐怖]</a></strong><strong>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-banging-shield-jumpscare-horror\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">骷髏敲盾跳嚇</a><br></strong><em>如果你還有更多點子，歡迎在評論區告訴我！</em><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">看看我的其他（正經）RPG 模組<br></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiritborne-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Spiritborne RPG</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spritborne-ascendants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Spritborne Ascendants</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiritborne-riftbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spiritborne Riftbound</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/riftbound-jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Riftbound Jewelry</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
